 ## Revision reports across out-of-order commit dates
 
 Workspace CLI test runner: `test/helpers/workspace-cli.js:8` keeps positional cwd, raw inherited environment with the update check disabled last, twenty-second limit, implicit streams and original error/result behavior. Doctor, worktree help and wiki startup/tidy cases retain their exact fixtures and real local metadata work. Check: `node --test test/start-here-doctor.test.js test/worktree-ship-help.test.js test/wiki-metabolism-warning.test.js`.
+
+## Every member run ends landed or dropped
+
+A member run in its own copy ends landed (in the main branch, or handed to the merge line by autoland) or dropped (made no change; copy and branch removed). Anything else is unfinished. The member finishes it before its next step: autoland, then autoland again after a fetch, then a keep-or-drop question in the feed with the branch kept. Record: `.atris/state/member-runs.json` in the main checkout. `lib/member-runs.js` listMemberRuns, `lib/member-runs.js` moveRunRecord (moves the run's own ignored mission state out so the usual removal can take the copy), `lib/member-runs.js` finishRun, `lib/member-runs.js` finishMemberRuns, `lib/member-runs.js` noteRunStart, `lib/member-runs.js` settleRunEnd. Gates: `commands/member.js` memberFinishEarlierRuns (in startMemberRunMission and before member go claims a job at `commands/member.js:10204`), `commands/member.js` settleMemberRun. Check: `commands/worktree.js` runsCommand, `atris worktree runs` exits 1 while any run is unfinished. Tests: `node --test test/member-runs.test.js`.
